WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.189
George hated worms.

2
00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.343
He didn't like to touch them.

3
00:00:05.344 --> 00:00:09.639
He didn't even like to look at them.

4
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:12.541
"Yikes! It's a worm.

5
00:00:12.542 --> 00:00:16.506
I hate worms," screamed George.

6
00:00:16.507 --> 00:00:19.100
"What? You hate me?

7
00:00:19.101 --> 00:00:26.069
Do you also hate those pretty flowers?" asked the earthworm.

8
00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:30.185
"No, I like them," said George.

9
00:00:30.186 --> 00:00:33.577
"Well, then, you must like me too.

10
00:00:33.578 --> 00:00:39.879
I help all of those grow," said the worm.

11
00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:43.314
George had never seen a talking earthworm.

12
00:00:43.315 --> 00:00:46.231
But he still didn't like worms.

13
00:00:46.232 --> 00:00:48.844
"I am a great digger.

14
00:00:48.845 --> 00:00:56.350
I dig holes that help air and water get into the ground," said the worm.

15
00:00:56.351 --> 00:01:00.346
"Plants need a lot of air and water to grow.

16
00:01:00.347 --> 00:01:05.886
Without me the plants could not grow," said the worm with pride.

17
00:01:05.887 --> 00:01:10.711
But George still didn't like worms.

18
00:01:10.712 --> 00:01:15.093
"I also make food for the plants," said the worm.

19
00:01:15.094 --> 00:01:18.880
"Really? How?" asked George.

20
00:01:18.881 --> 00:01:24.934
"I eat soil that is filled with small bits of plants and bacteria.

21
00:01:24.935 --> 00:01:31.495
They go through my body and out the other end," said the worm.

22
00:01:31.496 --> 00:01:37.872
"Plants eat your poo?" asked George with a laugh.

23
00:01:37.873 --> 00:01:43.147
"That's right! It is called fertilizer," said the worm.

24
00:01:43.148 --> 00:01:45.611
"But you are so small.

25
00:01:45.612 --> 00:01:51.161
How can one little worm help?" asked George.

26
00:01:51.162 --> 00:01:56.011
George did not know that the earthworm was not alone.

27
00:01:56.012 --> 00:02:02.443
Even in George's small garden, there were more than five hundred earthworms.

28
00:02:02.444 --> 00:02:10.576
"All my friends work together to help your garden," said the worm.

29
00:02:10.577 --> 00:02:13.509
"So do you still hate me?"

30
00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:21.543
In a shy voice, George said, "No, but you are very dirty and yucky."

31
00:02:21.544 --> 00:02:25.129
"I'm not dirty. I am very clean.

32
00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:30.817
Feel me!" said the worm.

33
00:02:30.818 --> 00:02:35.018
"Well, I don't know," George said quietly.

34
00:02:35.019 --> 00:02:36.736
"Come on!"

35
00:02:36.737 --> 00:02:39.812
George carefully touched the worm.

36
00:02:39.813 --> 00:02:45.644
"See! I'm not so bad," said the worm.

37
00:02:45.645 --> 00:02:50.629
"Actually, you are kind of soft," admitted George.

38
00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:54.208
Now George was beginning to like the worm.

39
00:02:54.209 --> 00:03:01.017
"But, Worm, you don't have any bones," said George.

40
00:03:01.018 --> 00:03:04.690
"That's right! I don't have arms or legs.

41
00:03:04.691 --> 00:03:07.680
I don't need them," explained the worm.

42
00:03:07.681 --> 00:03:09.675
"You don't need them?

43
00:03:09.676 --> 00:03:13.135
How do you move?" asked George.

44
00:03:13.136 --> 00:03:17.447
"I have muscles that go all around my body.

45
00:03:17.448 --> 00:03:27.507
I use them to push through the ground. Watch!"

46
00:03:27.508 --> 00:03:33.916
"It must take a long time for you to go anywhere," George said with a laugh.

47
00:03:33.917 --> 00:03:40.575
"That's true. I am a very slow mover, but I like it here in your garden.

48
00:03:40.576 --> 00:03:47.803
So I don't want to go very far," said the worm.

49
00:03:47.804 --> 00:03:51.314
"Well, I am glad you are in my garden.

50
00:03:51.315 --> 00:03:55.631
You are a great helper," said George with a smile.

51
00:03:55.632 --> 00:04:00.489
"Remember, worms are your friends," said the worm.

52
00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:05.494
"I will!" said George.

